  "details": "enable spout streaming\n\nimport 4 paths\n\nenable multistreaming\n\nstart dolly\n\nVRCSender2, 3 and 4 look different than VRCSender1\n\nVRSL light projection image is missing on the senders 2,3 and 4\n\nright after starting the Dolly, VRSL light projection image from VRCSender1 are bleeding into all other camera views (or some other sort of reflection  / projection)\n\nafter closing the camera and reopening it no lightprojections are visible on senders 2,3 and 4\n\nafter starting the dolly sometimes some of the cameras still see the camera path indicators (and clip through them)",
